SUMMARY:Restorative Reiki Reset with Senseful Wellness
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin us in this energetic reset for the m
 ind\, body\, and spirit. Receive personal reiki energy healing for chakras
  and aura clearing while exploring restorative yoga postures.\n\nYoga can 
 be done seated or on the mat and will be modified to adjust to your bodies
  needs. All poses will be held 5-10 minutes using props and added support.
 \n\n10 spaces only\, $22 per person (Cash/Card/Venmo)\n\nWe’ll have prop
 s but feel free to bring your own\nJenn has over 13 years experience in ph
 ysical therapy and combines body awareness cues and accommodations with al
 l her yoga offerings. Come as you are.
